auth
├── when reading a sign-in code
│   ├── it takes a bare code
│   ├── it takes a callback link
│   ├── it takes a redirect url
│   ├── it rejects a link with no code
│   ├── it rejects empty input
│   ├── it trims surrounding whitespace
│   └── it stops at a fragment
├── when checking sign-in state
│   ├── it rejects an authentication error page
│   ├── it ignores background windows
│   ├── it recognizes the sign-in page
│   ├── it recognizes an open file
│   ├── it ignores unrelated origins
│   └── it prefers signed out over a file
└── when waiting for a browser url
    ├── it reads the last nonempty line
    └── it times out for a missing file
